### 4.1 Real old-to-new updater attempt

The v0.1.20 Windows release ZIP was also downloaded and checksum-verified as a real old-release fixture:

```text
v0.1.20 ZIP SHA256=0D8E1F215AE4A02CDD604BB35A71751150B740AD52D8B028EEA065FC06DF51B0
manifest_matches=True
